      `my organisation` IS A `My provider` @desc Your registration and arrangements as a provider
GIVETH A `Yes or no`
`May I offer this approved VET course` MEANS
    CONSIDER `my role`
    WHEN `I run a training provider` THEN `yes if` (`May my provider offer me this course` `my organisation`)
    OTHERWISE `does not arise for you`

§§§ `ss 58A(3), 60D(1), 60I -- conferring a qualification`

@export May I confer this qualification on this person (Vocational Education and Training Act 1996 (WA) ss 58A(3), 60D(1), 60I)?
GIVEN `my role` IS A Role @desc Which of these describes you
      `the class` IS A `Qualification class` @desc How the Minister has classified the qualification
      `my organisation` IS A `My provider` @desc Your registration and arrangements as a provider
      `the person's completion` IS A `The person's completion` @desc What the person has done towards the qualification, and your assessment of them
GIVETH A `Yes or no`
`May I confer this qualification on this person` MEANS
    CONSIDER `my role`
    WHEN `I run a training provider` THEN `yes if` (`May my provider confer this qualification` `the class` `my organisation` (`the baseline's completion for` `the person's completion`))
    OTHERWISE `does not arise for you`

§§§ `s 58A -- penalty`

@export What is the most I can be fined for providing a course or conferring a qualification without being permitted, in dollars (Vocational Education and Training Act 1996 (WA) s 58A)?
