GIVETH AN `Amount`
`What is the most I can be fined as a provider` MEANS
    CONSIDER `my role`
    WHEN `I run a training provider` THEN amount (`What is the most the offender can be fined` `providing a course or conferring a qualification without being permitted (s 58A)`)
    OTHERWISE `does not arise for you`
